">\n                        <a href=\"/islands/chumbe-island/\">Chumbe Island Coral Park</a>\n                    </h3>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper ts-prose\">\n                    <p class=\"line-clamp-4 !text-sm !leading-7\">Chumbe Island Coral Park is an award-winning private nature reserve. It is located only a few kilometers off the southwest coast of Zanzibar, near Stone Town. The reserve includes a fully protected coral reef sanctuary and a forest reserve. It harbors rare wildlife, a visitor and education center, a small eco-lodge, nature walks and historical […]</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <a class=\"mb-4 mt-6 lg:mb-0 btn btn-small btn-red xl:btn--stretched lg:btn-green !grow-0 overview-card-btn\" href=\"/islands/chumbe-island/\">\n                View Island            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>","13347":"<article class=\"relative isolate flex flex-col bg-sand md:mx-0 lg:flex-row\">\n    <div class=\"relative card-media lg:w-5/12 lg:shrink-0 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img width=\"1024\" height=\"575\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Laba-Fanjove-Aerial-View-1024x575.avif\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full bg-grey object-cover wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Laba-Fanjove-Aerial-View-1024x575.avif 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Laba-Fanjove-Aerial-View-300x169.avif 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Laba-Fanjove-Aerial-View-768x432.avif 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Laba-Fanjove-Aerial-View-1536x863.avif 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Laba-Fanjove-Aerial-View-2048x1151.avif 2048w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Laba-Fanjove-Aerial-View-60x34.avif 60w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">        \n        <!-- Wishlist button -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4\">\n            <a href=\"#\" title=\"Wishlist\" class=\"flex justify-center items-center w-10 h-10 text-2x